sequenceDiagram
    actor Architect
    participant Toolbar as Edit Toolbar
    participant Session as Edit Session
    participant Plugin as Edit Plugin
    participant Writer as Workspace Writer
    participant Pipeline as DSL Pipeline
    participant Tools as Structurizr Tools
    participant Reload as Live Reload

    Architect->>Toolbar: Save
    Toolbar->>Session: save the edited views
    Session->>+Plugin: POST /__renderizr/save
    Plugin->>Writer: write the layouts
    alt the file changed since the page read it
        Writer-->>Plugin: stale version
        Plugin-->>Session: refuse the save
    else
        Writer-->>Plugin: new version
        Plugin-->>-Session: saved
        Plugin-)Reload: workspace event, naming the saving page
    end

    Note over Architect,Tools: In a DSL session
    Architect->>Plugin: change a file under the DSL's folder
    Plugin->>+Pipeline: run
    Pipeline->>Plugin: flush
    Plugin-)Reload: flush event, to save what waits
    Pipeline->>Tools: merge, with workspace.json as the layout
    alt the DSL parses
        Tools-->>Pipeline: workspace.json
        Pipeline->>Writer: write it
        Pipeline-->>-Plugin: published
        Plugin-)Reload: workspace event
        Reload->>Reload: swap the workspace in place
    else
        Tools-->>Pipeline: error
        Pipeline-->>Plugin: failed
        Plugin-)Reload: error event
    end
